        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be released in episodes. The first episode is titled <strong>&quot;My Name Is Ivan&quot;.  </strong>Currently, the second episode is in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964450/extras/b1ea7fe24b9d80e2f49ffaea3d1852c6.avif?t=1779740149\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964450/extras_big/b1ea7fe24b9d80e2f49ffaea3d1852c6.avif?t=1779740149 width=1560 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ivan</strong> is an ordinary teenager with one extraordinary ability: as a child, he discovered he could freeze objects. He lives with his parents, who know nothing about his unique gift. The only person he’s shared this secret with is his best friend, Mel, who always supports him and helps him navigate life’s challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964450/extras/98625b1e310484e22547e15a37e0a476.avif?t=1779740149\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964450/extras_big/98625b1e310484e22547e15a37e0a476.avif?t=1779740149 width=1560 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frosten: Two Realms</strong> An exciting story about a young man named Ivan, who possesses the unique ability to freeze objects. His life takes a dramatic turn when he finds himself in a mysterious world filled with magic and danger. Alongside friends—both old and new—Ivan must uncover the secrets of his gift and find his way home. This visual novel game blends detective, adventure, and drama elements, inviting players to immerse themselves in a magical world and unravel its mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964450/extras/40cdbc74cb1e146d959107005be64003.avif?t=1779740149\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964450/extras_big/40cdbc74cb1e146d959107005be64003.avif?t=1779740149 width=1560 height=414 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping plot with unexpected twists.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful locations that bring your adventure to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters whose emotions change based on dialogue choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique sound effects recorded specifically for the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games and puzzles to test your wits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be released in episodes. The first episode is titled <strong>&quot;My Name Is Ivan&quot;.  </strong>Currently, the second episode is in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964450/extras/b1ea7fe24b9d80e2f49ffaea3d1852c6.avif?t=1779740149\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964450/extras_big/b1ea7fe24b9d80e2f49ffaea3d1852c6.avif?t=1779740149 width=1560 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ivan</strong> is an ordinary teenager with one extraordinary ability: as a child, he discovered he could freeze objects. He lives with his parents, who know nothing about his unique gift. The only person he’s shared this secret with is his best friend, Mel, who always supports him and helps him navigate life’s challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964450/extras/98625b1e310484e22547e15a37e0a476.avif?t=1779740149\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964450/extras_big/98625b1e310484e22547e15a37e0a476.avif?t=1779740149 width=1560 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frosten: Two Realms</strong> An exciting story about a young man named Ivan, who possesses the unique ability to freeze objects. His life takes a dramatic turn when he finds himself in a mysterious world filled with magic and danger. Alongside friends—both old and new—Ivan must uncover the secrets of his gift and find his way home. This visual novel game blends detective, adventure, and drama elements, inviting players to immerse themselves in a magical world and unravel its mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964450/extras/40cdbc74cb1e146d959107005be64003.avif?t=1779740149\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964450/extras_big/40cdbc74cb1e146d959107005be64003.avif?t=1779740149 width=1560 height=414 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping plot with unexpected twists.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful locations that bring your adventure to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters whose emotions change based on dialogue choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique sound effects recorded specifically for the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games and puzzles to test your wits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
